<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Beats & Buns - Food + Music Events</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin:0; color:#222; }
    header { background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504674900247-0877df9cc836') center/cover no-repeat; color: #fff; text-align:center; padding:72px 16px; }
    header h1{ font-size:2.6rem; margin:0 0 8px; }
    header p{ margin:0 0 18px; font-size:1.05rem; opacity:0.95; }
    .cta { background:#ff5733; color:#fff; padding:12px 20px; border-radius:6px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600; }
    main{ max-width:1000px; margin:28px auto; padding:0 16px; }
    section{ margin-bottom:28px; }
    .cards{ display:flex; gap:16px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
    .card{ flex:1 1 calc(33% - 16px); background:#f8f8f8; padding:16px; border-radius:8px; min-width:220px; }
    .gallery{ display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
    .gallery img{ width:calc(33% - 8px); border-radius:6px; }
    footer{ background:#111; color:#fff; text-align:center; padding:16px; margin-top:18px;}
    @media(max-width:768px){ .card{ flex:1 1 100%; } .gallery img{ width:100%; } header h1{ font-size:1.8rem; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Beats & Buns</h1>
    <p>Gourmet Burgers • Artisan Pizzas • Live Music — Premium events that people remember.</p>
    <a class="cta" href="https://wa.me/919999999999" target="_blank">Book Now on WhatsApp</a>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section>
      <h2>About</h2>
      <p>We combine handcrafted burgers & pizzas with soulful live music for corporates, weddings and private parties. End-to-end service: food, sound, performance and presentation.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Packages</h2>
      <div class="cards">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Corporate Evenings</h3>
          <p>Full food + live set for team events — starting ₹1.5 Lakh.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Luxury Birthdays</h3>
          <p>Private gourmet menu + acoustic performance — from ₹50K.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Wedding Specials</h3>
          <p>Food & Music corner for weddings — from ₹2 Lakh.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Gallery</h2>
      <div class="gallery">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1606756790123-c9c24e853f61" alt="Burger">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1540189549336-e6e99c3679fe" alt="Pizza">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511671782779-c97d3d27a1d4" alt="Live Music">
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>WhatsApp: <a href="https://wa.me/919999999999" target="_blank">+91 99999 99999</a> • Email: hello@beatsandbuns.com</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; <span id="yr"></span> Beats & Buns. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>

  <script>document.getElementById('yr').innerText = new Date().getFullYear();</script>
</body>
</html>
